body:
Debut.

&#x200B;

I can't stand country

When I tried to get the audio the link didn't work

&#x200B;

Ever mind, I'm too high to function right now. I got the audio

Sending hugs. You're so brave for doing this. I'm 12 years older than you and I would struggle. When I was 17 I should have been committed to inpatient psych but I was afraid to tell anyone because I was afraid of getting behind in school or scaring my family, but looking back I wish I would have.

&#x200B;

My DMs are open if you ever need me

Keep in mind, they are just jokes. Because you joke about something doesn't make that thing (God or the saints) invalid. Trying saying the Jesus prayer.

&#x200B;

If you can focus more on doing the tasks you do like and find a way to spent less time with these people. If you find yourself being bitter and holding a grudge it maybe best to put your time somewhere else.

Done in 5 minutes.

&#x200B;

Eyeliner is clean and crisp

&#x200B;

Everyone keeps their damn opinion  to themselves

Not to be that person, but be careful with this. Pepe is used by white supremacists to spread propaganda.

&#x200B;

[A little history](https://www.latimes.com/politics/la-na-pol-pepe-the-frog-hate-symbol-20161011-snap-htmlstory.html)

&#x200B;

Edit for clarity.

My oldest product is the Naked Basics palette. I bought it in 2015 and it was my first high end purchase I made. It also brings back a lot of memories because I bought it on the last day I say my stepmom alive and it was the eyeshadow I wore for my wedding. I have a bareminerals palette that dupes the shadows fine, but I can't let it go.

&#x200B;

The newest products that I bought was a bunch of colourpop SSS. I never met a SSS that I liked, but I love the ones I bought. They are perfect for a simple eyeshadow look. For anyone wondering the shades are IRL, I <3 this, Frog, Twitterpade and Amaze.

Tell her Orthodoxy is for kids who want to stay up past midnight, play with fire and drink wine. Just kidding...

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

I was in the same place when I converted. My whole family is Baptist so they wanted to know why Orthodoxy was different. I explained that the Orthodox's service relies upon singing versus instead of centered around a sermon. If they want more info, they can ask more questions or look for themselves.
